Cupertino default asset pack (cupertino-data)

manifest.json, icon-map.toml: GPL-3.0-or-later (the Cupertino licence).
fonts/InterVariable-subset.ttf: Inter, a subset; SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL-1.1), see OFL.txt.
wallpapers/*.jpg: six photographs from Unsplash, Unsplash License (LicenseRef-Unsplash), see
  Unsplash.txt; photographers and sources in wallpapers/credits.txt.

The host icon theme (Adwaita) is a separate package and is not included.
Cursors are the built-in set of cupertino-cursor.
